{"doc_id":"REPORT-news_r-04237-00001","summaries":{"A":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":2,"utility":2,"evidence":["해당 검사 4명은 바로 사직서를 냈다.","바 장관에 대해선 “트럼프의 하수인”(뉴욕타임스), “트럼프의 장난감”(워싱턴포스트)이라는 비난이 쏟아졌다."],"reason":"The summary says Barr 'poured out' the criticism that he was a lackey or toy. In the source, the media (NYT and WaPo) made those criticisms of Barr. It also leaves out that the Justice Department lowered its sentencing recommendation after the tweet, so the cause of the controversy is unclear. Its wording is awkward."},"B":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":3,"evidence":["트윗 후 법무부는 “스톤에 대한 구형량을 낮추겠다”라고 전격 발표했다.","해당 검사 4명은 바로 사직서를 냈다."],"reason":"Everything it states matches the source, and it reads naturally. It omits the Justice Department's reduction of the recommendation after Trump's tweet and the prosecutors' resignations. It also leaves out that Barr's tweet comments were made in an interview."},"C":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":2,"utility":2,"evidence":["트럼프 대통령은 “...9년이라는 말도 안 되는 형량을 구형하고 황급히 도망갔다”고 적었다.","바 장관은 지난 14일 ... 폭로했다."],"reason":"The summary garbles the sequence, saying the prosecution recommended 7~9 years and the Justice Department then announced a reduction. It also suggests Barr 'protested' Trump's tweets, which the source presents as only one of two interpretations. It leaves out the resignations and the signature count, and it reads awkwardly."},"D":{"adequacy":1,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":2,"utility":1,"evidence":["트럼프 대통령은 “도대체 이 4명의 검사는 누구냐”라며","검찰이 7~9년을 구형하자 트럼프 대통령은 지난 11일 트윗으로 검찰을 정면 비판했다."],"reason":"The summary attributes Trump's 11th tweet to Barr, and says Barr made the prosecutors resign, which is wrong. The sentence containing the resignations is also self-contradictory. It leaves out the former officials' statement."}}}
